+# Solution
+
+- **Invalid Makefile recipe indentation:** replaced spaces with the tab required by `make` for the pytest recipe.
+- **Broken check-script execution:** restored the executable bit on `scripts/run_checks.sh` and converted its CRLF line endings to LF so Linux can resolve the shebang interpreter.
+- **Invalid JSON configuration:** removed the trailing comma from `data/config.json` so the existing validator can parse it.
+
+`make test` now completes successfully with all configuration checks intact and all 3 tests passing.
